{"name":"中转 API 停机通知","dsl":{"schema":"2.0","config":{"update_multi":true,"style":{"text_size":{"normal_v2":{"default":"normal","pc":"normal","mobile":"heading"}}}},"body":{"direction":"vertical","elements":[{"tag":"markdown","content":"**停机原因**：对 ai.wuji.tech 中转 API 端点进行维护升级，以提升服务稳定性\n**停机时间**：2026 年 6 月 10 日 21:00 - 21:30\n**预计时长**：约 30 分钟\n**影响范围**：ai.wuji.tech 中转 API 端点暂时不可用，相关业务、脚本、自动化任务会调用失败","text_align":"left","text_size":"normal_v2","margin":"0px 0px 8px 0px"},{"tag":"column_set","flex_mode":"stretch","horizontal_align":"left","columns":[{"tag":"column","width":"weighted","background_style":"red-50","elements":[{"tag":"markdown","content":"请相关同事提前暂停或调整依赖 ai.wuji.tech 中转 API 的定时任务、自动化脚本和上线安排。维护完成或时间有调整，会在群内同步通知。\n如有问题请联系 IT：李超奇","text_align":"left","text_size":"normal"}],"padding":"10px 12px 10px 12px","vertical_spacing":"4px","horizontal_align":"left","vertical_align":"top","weight":1}],"margin":"4px 0px 8px 0px"},{"tag":"button","text":{"tag":"plain_text","content":"点进进入 IT 人工服务台"},"type":"primary_filled","width":"fill","confirm":{"title":{"tag":"plain_text","content":"IT 人工服务"},"text":{"tag":"plain_text","content":"请问是否进入人工服务"}},"behaviors":[{"type":"callback","value":{"action":"confirm_acknowledgment"}},{"type":"open_url","default_url":"https://applink.feishu.cn/T96YcKMUM4Ky","pc_url":"https://applink.feishu.cn/T96YcKMUM4Ky","ios_url":"https://applink.feishu.cn/T96YcKMUM4Ky","android_url":"https://applink.feishu.cn/T96YcKMUM4Ky"}],"margin":"8px 0px 4px 0px","element_id":"it_service_desk"},{"tag":"hr"},{"tag":"markdown","content":"**<font color='red'>舞肌科技 · 总裁办</font>**","text_align":"right","text_size":"normal","margin":"4px 0px 0px 0px"}]},"header":{"title":{"tag":"plain_text","content":"中转 API 停机通知"},"subtitle":{"tag":"plain_text","content":"6 月 10 日 21:00 - 21:30"},"template":"red","padding":"12px 8px 12px 8px"}},"variables":[]}